  "description": "Signer.Digital .NET Core Library provides methods to sign pdf document (including multiple signatures) on server with digital signature on the client's browsers. This uses Signer.Digital browser extension.  Signer.Digital browser extension host does not have any prerequisit and runs native on Windows and Linux.\n\nThe library also has methods to get list of digital signatures on pdf document along with validation status, and to verify certificate.\n\nThe library also provides methods required to implement Web PKI Authentication.\n\nFree Version provides signing sigle page pdf documents.",
